# Netlify redirects for bank-ai.netlify.app
#
# The privacy policy now lives in the app's own repository, so the page that
# describes what the app collects and the code that collects it change
# together. This forwards the old address to it.
#
# The site root is NOT redirected, and must not be: it is the Google OAuth2
# disclosure page for the gmail_readonly scope, and taking it down removes a
# document Google's verification requires.

/policy      https://osuyaalex.github.io/bank_app/policy/  301
/policy/*    https://osuyaalex.github.io/bank_app/policy/  301
